  "content": "<p>這個模組旨在透過賦予雪球額外功能來增強其威力。</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>目前功能包括</p><ul>\n<li>被雪球擊中會獲得短暫的緩速減益效果。</li>\n<li>岩漿立方怪和烈焰使者等火焰生物被雪球擊中時會受到傷害。</li>\n</ul><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>喜歡這個模組並想支持我？</strong></p><ul>\n<li>在&nbsp;<a href=\"https://twitter.com/DarkhaxDev\" rel=\"nofollow\">Twitter</a>&nbsp;上追蹤我</li>\n<li>加入我的&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/linkout?remoteUrl=https://discord.darkhax.net/\" rel=\"nofollow\">Discord</a></li>\n<li>在&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/Darkhax\" rel=\"nofollow\">Patreon</a>&nbsp;上贊助我</li>\n<li>查看我的&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/linkout?remoteUrl=https://darkhax.net/\" rel=\"nofollow\">網站</a></li>\n</ul><p>&nbsp;</p><p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/linkout?remoteUrl=https://nodecraft.com/r/darkhax\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://nodecraft.com/assets/images/logo-dark.png\" width=\"384\" height=\"90\"></a><br>本專案由 Nodecraft 贊助。使用優惠碼&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/linkout?remoteUrl=https://nodecraft.com/r/darkhax\" rel=\"nofollow\">Darkhax</a>&nbsp;即可享有首月服務 30% 折扣！<img src=\"https://skulk.blmj.red/stronger-snowballs\" alt=\"\" width=\"1\" height=\"1\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>標誌由 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fgame-icons.net%252f1x1%252florc%252fcrumbling-ball.html\" rel=\"nofollow\">Lorc</a> 於 Game Icons 提供，並依據 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/linkout?remoteUrl=https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/3.0/\" rel=\"nofollow\">CC By 3.0</a> 授權使用。</p>",
